00:03:22.033 --> 00:03:23.734
-It's not raining out.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.601
-Hey, get this.

00:03:26.601 --> 00:03:29.767
I read about a runner who took
third place in an ultramarathon

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:31.767
