after admitting

00:03:31.767 --> 00:03:33.367
that she used a car.

00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:35.868
[ Audience groans ]

00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:37.467
The saddest part is
that she used a car

00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:38.767
